worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_factual_qa.js"
  ceiling 576
  rationale "Subject-verified factual Q&A (issue #1172 R2, R6, R7), the browser twin of rust/src/solver_handlers/factual_qa.rs and rust/src/solver_handlers/prompt_text_question.rs. The subject gate resolves the formalized question's subject slot to a Q-id through the fact store's own label index; seeded comparisons align both subjects' facts by relation; questions over a quoted passage answer from its own sentences with no network call. Cues are meanings of data/seed/meanings-facts.lino and the wording is data/seed/multilingual-responses-entities.lino; growth is the ported handler, not silent regrowth. Ceiling moved 475 to 576 for the issue #1172 R3 live-answer twin of rust/src/solver_handlers/fact_live_answer.rs: factLiveQuestion formalizes the relation and subject term from seed cues, factClaimReference reads the reference URL the claim cites through the registry row, and factLiveSummary renders the seeded fact_live_answer template; formal_ai_worker_10.js dropped its hardcoded FACT_RESPONSE_TEMPLATES table and the unused sitelink helper in the same move."
